#. Enable/Disable Kdump - RadioButtons 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:36
msgid ""
"<p><b>Enable/Disable Kdump</b><br>\n"
"    Enable or disable kdump. The \"crashkernel\" boot parameter is added/"
"removed. \n"
"    To apply changes, a reboot is necessary.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Omogoči/Onemogoči Kdump</b><br>\n"
"    Omogočite ali onemogočite kdump. Doda/odstrani se zagonski parameter "
"»crashkernel«.\n"
"    Za uveljavitev sprememb je potreben ponovni zagon sistema.<br></p>\n"

#. Kdump Memor&y [MB] - IntField 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:42
msgid ""
"<p><b>Kdump Memory</b><br>\n"
"    Allocation of memory for the kdump kernel.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Pomnilnik za Kdump</b><br>\n"
"    Dodelitev pomnilnika za jedro kdump.</p>"

#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:45
msgid ""
"<p>On AMD64/Intel 64 computers, the <i>High</i> value means reserving all "
"available memory. The <i>Low</i> value means reserving memory in the DMA32 "
"zone, that is, all the memory up to the 4 GB mark.<br>\n"
"<i>Low</i> is the amount of memory required by 32-bit-only devices. The "
"kernel will allocate 64M for DMA32 bounce buffers. If your server does not "
"have any 32-bit-only devices, everything should work with the default "
"allocation of 72M for <i>Low</i>. A possible exception to this is on NUMA "
"machines, which may make it appear that more Low memory is needed. The Kdump "
"kernel may be booted with numa=off to make sure normal kernel allocations do "
"not use <i>Low</i> memory."
msgstr ""
"<p>Na računalnikih AMD64/Intel64 vrednost <i>Visoki</i> pomeni rezervacijo "
"vsega razpoložljivega pomnilnika. Vrednost <i>Nizki</i> pomeni rezervacijo "
"pomnilnika v območju DMA32, to je ves pomnilnik do velikosti 4 GB.<br>\n"
"\n"
"<i>Nizka</i> je količina pomnilnika, ki jo potrebujejo naprave, ki so samo "
"32-bitne. Jedro bo dodelilo 64 M za odskočne medpomnilnike DMA32. Če "
"računalnik ne vsebuje naprav, ki so samo 32-bitne, bi vse moralo delovati s "
"privzeto dodelitvijo 72 M za <i>Nizko</i>. Možna izjema so računalniki NUMA, "
"kjer se lahko zdi, da je potrebnega več nizkega pomnilnika. Jedro za Kdump "
"je moč zagnat z možnostjo »numa=off« in tako zagotoviti, da se za običajne "
"dodelitve jedra ne uporablja <i>Nizki</i> pomnilnik."

#. T: help text for a combo box
#. description taken from http://lparbox.com/how-to/aix/19
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:54
msgid ""
"<p><b>Firmware-Assisted Dump</b><br>\n"
"    Dumps are not generated before the partition is reinitialized but take "
"place     when the partition is restarting. When performing a firmware-"
"assisted dump,     system memory is frozen and the partition rebooted, which "
"allows a new instance     of the operating system to dump data from the "
"previous kernel crash.    This feature is suitable only when the system has "
"more than 1.5 GB of memory.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Odložen izpis s pomočjo strojne programske opreme</b><br>\n"
"Odloženi izpisi niso ustvarjeni pred re-inicializacijo razdelka, ampak ko se "
"razdelek znova zaganja. Ko se izvaja odlaganje izpisa s pomočjo strojne "
"programske opreme, se zamrzne sistemski pomnilnik in znova zažene razdelek. "
"To novemu primerku operacijskega sistema omogoči odlaganje izpisa podatkov "
"sesutja prejšnjega jedra. Ta zmožnost je primerna samo za sisteme, ki imajo "
"več kot 1,5 GB pomnilnika.</p>"

#. Kdump Memor&y [MB] - IntField 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:65
msgid ""
"<p><b>Dump Level</b><br>\n"
"    Specify the type of necessary page for analysis.\n"
"    Pages of the specified type are copied to the dumpfile. \n"
"    The page type marked in the following table is included. <br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Stopnja odloženega izpisa</b><br>\n"
"    Določite vrsto potrebne pomnilniške strani za analizo.\n"
"    Strani te vrste so skopirane v datoteko odloženega izpisa.\n"
"    Vključena je vrsta strani, ki je označena v naslednji razpredelnici."
"<br></p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:72
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p><b>Dump Format</b><br>\n"
#| "    <i>No Dump</i> - Only save the kernel log.<br>\n"
#| "    <i>ELF Format</i> - Create dump file in ELF format.<br>\n"
#| "    <i>Compressed Format</i> - Compress dump data by each page with gzip."
#| "<br>\n"
#| "    <i>LZO Compressed Format</i> - Slightly bigger files but much faster."
#| "<br>\n"
#| "</p>    <i>Snappy Compressed Format</i> - Considerably faster, 64-bit "
#| "optimized.<br>\n"
#| "</p>    <i>Zstandard Compressed Format</i> - Smaller files, slower.<br>\n"
#| "</p>    <i>Raw copy of /proc/vmcore</i> - does not use makedumpfile.<br>\n"
#| "</p>"
msgid ""
"<p><b>Dump Format</b><br>\n"
"    <i>No Dump</i> - Only save the kernel log.<br>\n"
"    <i>ELF Format</i> - Create dump file in ELF format.<br>\n"
"    <i>Compressed Format</i> - Compress dump data by each page with gzip."
"<br>\n"
"    <i>LZO Compressed Format</i> - Slightly bigger files but much faster."
"<br>\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Oblika odloženega izpisa</b><br>\n"
"    <i>Brez odloženega izpisa</i> — Shrani samo dnevnik jedra.<br>\n"
"    <i>Oblika ELF</i> — Ustvari datoteko odloženega izpisa v obliki ELF."
"<br>\n"
"    <i>Stisnjena oblika</i> — Vsako ločeno stran podatkov odloženega izpisa "
"stisne z gzip.<br>\n"
"    <i>Oblika stisnjena z LZO</i> — Malenkost večje datoteke, a je "
"razširjanje precej hitrejše.<br>\n"
"    <i>Oblika stisnjena s Snappy</i> — Občutno hitrejše, optimizirano za 64-"
"bitne računalnike.<br>\n"
"    <i>Oblika stisnjena z Zstandard</i> — Manjše datoteke in počasnejše "
"razširjanje.<br>\n"
"    <i>Neobdelana kopija /proc/vmcore</i> — Ne uporablja makedumpfile.<br>\n"
"</p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  1/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:80
msgid ""
"<p><b>Saving Target for Kdump Image</b><br>\n"
"    The target for saving kdump images. Select the target type for saving "
"dumps.<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Cilj shranjevanja za Kdump</b><br>\n"
"    Cilj za shranjevanje odloženih izpisov Kdump. Izberite vrsto cilja za "
"shranjevanje.<br></p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  2/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:84
msgid ""
"<p><b>Local Filesystem</b> - Save the kdump image in the local filesystem.\n"
"    <i>Directory for Saving Dumps</i> - The path for saving kdump images.\n"
"    Selecting directory for saving kdump images via dialog by pressing "
"<i>Browse</i>\n"
"    <br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Krajevni datotečni sistem</b> — Odloženi izpis Kdump shrani na "
"krajevni datotečni sistem.\n"
"    <i>Mapa za shranjevanje odloženih izpisov</i> — Pot za shranjevanje "
"odloženih posnetkov Kdump.\n"
"    Mapo za shranjevanje lahko izberete s klikom na gumb <i>Brskanje</"
"i><br>\n"
"    </p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  3/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:91
msgid ""
"<p><b>FTP</b> - Save kdump image via FTP.\n"
"    <i>Server Name</i> - The name of the ftp server.\n"
"    <i>Port</i> - The port number for the connection.\n"
"    <i>Directory on Server</i> - The path for saving kdump images.\n"
"    <i>Enable Anonymous FTP</i> enables anonymous connection to the server.\n"
"    <i>User Name</i> for ftp connection. <i>Password</i> for ftp connection."
"<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>FTP</b> — Odloženi izpis Kdump shrani na strežnik FTP.\n"
"    <i>Ime strežnika</i> — Ime strežnika FTP.\n"
"    <i>Vrata</i> — Številka vrat za povezavo.\n"
"    <i>Mapa na strežniku</i> — Pot za shranjevanje odloženih izpisov.\n"
"    <i>Omogoči anonimni FTP</i> omogoči anonimno povezavo na strežnik FTP.\n"
"    <i>Uporabniško ime</i> za povezavo. <i>Geslo</i> za povezavo FTP.<br></p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  4/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:100
msgid ""
"<p><b>SSH</b> - Save kdump image via SSH and 'dd' on target machine.\n"
"    <i>Server Name</i> - The name of the server.\n"
"    <i>Port</i> - The port number for the connection.\n"
"    <i>Directory on Server</i> - The path for saving kdump images.\n"
"    <i>User Name</i> for SSH connection.  \n"
"    <i>Password</i> for SSH connection.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>SSH</b> — Odloženi izpis Kdump s pomočjo SSH in »dd« shrani na "
"oddaljeni računalnik\n"
"    <i>Ime strežnika</i> — Ime strežnika.\n"
"    <i>Vrata</i> — Številka vrat za povezavo.\n"
"    <i>Mapa na strežniku</i> — Pot za shranjevanje odloženih izpisov.\n"
"    <i>Uporabniško ime</i> za povezavo SSH.\n"
"    <i>Geslo</i> za povezavo SSH.<br></p>\n"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  5/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:109
msgid ""
"<p><b>SFTP</b> - Save kdump image via SFTP.\n"
"    <i>Server Name</i> - The name of the server.\n"
"    <i>Port</i> - The port number for the connection.\n"
"    <i>Directory on Server</i> - The path for saving kdump images.\n"
"    <i>User Name</i> for SSH connection.  \n"
"    <i>Password</i> for SSH connection.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>SFTP</b> — Odloženi izpis Kdump shrani na strežnik SFTP.\n"
"    <i>Ime strežnika</i> — Ime strežnika SFTP.\n"
"    <i>Vrata</i> — Številka vrat za povezavo.\n"
"    <i>Mapa na strežniku</i> — Pot za shranjevanje odloženih izpisov.\n"
"    <i>Uporabniško ime</i> za povezavo SSH.\n"
"    <i>Geslo</i> za povezavo SSH.<br></p>\n"

#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:117
msgid ""
"<p>The choice between SSH and SFTP depends\n"
"on details of server configuration. SLE servers support both\n"
"by default.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Izbor SSH ali SFTP je odvisen od\n"
"podrobnosti nastavitev strežnika. Strežniki\n"
"SLE privzeto podpirajo oba.</p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  6/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:123
msgid ""
"<p><b>NFS</b> - Save kdump image on NFS.\n"
"    <i>Server Name</i> - The name of the nfs server.\n"
"    <i>Directory on Server</i> - The path for saving kdump images.<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>NFS</b> — Odloženi izpis Kdump shrani na strežnik NFS.\n"
"    <i>Ime strežnika</i> — Ime strežnika NFS.\n"
"    <i>Mapa na strežniku</i> — Pot za shranjevanje odloženih izpisov.<br></p>"

#. Dump Format - RadioButtons  7/7
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:129
msgid ""
"<p><b>CIFS</b> - Save kdump image via CIFS.\n"
"    <i>Server Name</i> - The name of the server.\n"
"    <i>Exported Share</i> - The windows share name.\n"
"    <i>Directory on Server</i> - The path for saving kdump images.\n"
"    <i>Use Authentication</i> enables authenticated connection to the "
"server.\n"
"    <i>User Name</i> for the connection. <i>Password</i> for the connection."
"<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>CIFS</b> — Odloženi izpis Kdump shrani na strežnik CIFS.\n"
"    <i>Ime strežnika</i> — Ime strežnika CIFS.\n"
"    <i>Izvožena delitev</i> — Ime izvožene delitve.\n"
"    <i>Mapa na strežniku</i> — Pot za shranjevanje odloženih izpisov.\n"
"    <i>Uporabi overjanje</i> omogoči overjeno povezavo na strežnik.\n"
"    <i>Uporabniško ime</i> za povezavo. <i>Geslo</i> za povezavo.<br></p>"

#. Custom Kdump Kernel - TextEntry 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:138
msgid ""
"<p><b>Custom Kdump Kernel</b> The user can enter the custom kernel.\n"
"    The naming scheme is:<i>/boot/vmlinu[zx]-<kernel_string>[.gz]</i>\n"
"    Please enter only <i>kernel_string</i>.<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Jedro po meri za Kdump</b> Uporabnik lahko vnese jedro po meri.\n"
"    Oblika imena je: <i>/boot/vmlinu[xz]-<niz_jedra>[.gz]</i>\n"
"    Vnesite samo <i>niz_jedra</i> in nič drugega.<br></p>"

#. Kdump Command Line - TextEntry 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:144
msgid ""
"<p><b>Kdump Command Line</b>\n"
"    Additional arguments passed to kexec. <br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Ukazna vrstica za Kdump</b>\n"
"    Dodatni argumenti za posredovati do kexec.<br></p>"

#. Kdump Command Line Append - TextEntry 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:148
msgid ""
"<p><b>Kdump Command Line Append</b>\n"
"    Set this option to _append_ values to the default command line string. \n"
"    The string will be appended if the <i>Kdump Command Line</i>\n"
"    is set. <br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Dodatek ukazni vrstici za Kdump</b>\n"
"    Nastavite to možnost, da _dodate_ vrednosti nizu privzete ukazne "
"vrstice.\n"
"    Niz bo dodan, če je nastavljena možnost\n"
"    <i>Ukazna vrstica za Kdump</i>.<br></p>\n"

#. Enable Immediate Reboot After Saving the Core - CheckBox 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:155
msgid ""
"<p><b>Enable Immediate Reboot After Saving the Core</b> - \n"
"    Enable immediate reboot after saving the core in the kdump.<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Takojšnji ponovni zagon po shranitvi izpisa jedra</b> — \n"
"    Po shranitvi odloženega izpisa Kdump se omogoči takojšnji ponovni zagon "
"sistema.<br></p>"

#. Enable Delete Old Dump Images - CheckBox 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:159
msgid ""
"<p><b>Enable Delete Old Dump Images</b> - \n"
"    Enable Delete Old Dump Images. If the number of dump files in \n"
"    <i>Number of Old Dumps</i> exceeds this number, older dumps are removed."
"<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Izbriši stare odložene izpise</b> — \n"
"    Omogoči izbris starih odloženih izpisov. Če število datotek presega "
"število v možnosti\n"
"    <i>Število starih odloženih izpisov</i>, bodo najstarejše odvečne "
"datoteke odstranjene.<br></p>"

#. Enable Copy Ke&rnel into the Dump Directory - CheckBox 1/1
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:165
msgid ""
"<p><b>Enable Copy Kernel into the Dump Directory</b> - \n"
"    If this option is selected, the kernel and the\n"
"      debugging information (if installed) are copied into the dump\n"
"      directory. The default is \"off\". It is useful to have\n"
"      everything in place for debugging.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""

#. SMTP Server
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:173
msgid ""
"<p><b>SMTP Server</b> used for sending a notification email after a dump.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Strežnik SMTP</b>, ki bo po odloženem izpisu uporabljen za pošiljanje "
"obvestila po e-pošti.</p>"

#. SMTP User Name
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:177
msgid ""
"<p><b>User Name</b> for SMTP authentication when <i>SMTP Server</i> is\n"
"  set. This is optional. If you do not specifiy a username and password, "
"plain SMTP will be used.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Uporabniško ime</b> za overjanje SMTP, ko je omogočena možnost "
"<i>Strežnik SMTP</i>.\n"
"  To ni obvezno. Če uporabniškega imena in gesla ne določite, bo uporabljen "
"navadni SMTP.</p>\n"

#. SMTP Password
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:181
msgid ""
"<p><b>Password</b> for SMTP authentication when <i>SMTP Server</i> is set. "
"This\n"
"  is optional. If you do not specify a username and password, plain SMTP "
"will be used.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Geslo</b> za overjanje SMTP, ko je nastavljena možnost <i>Strežnik "
"SMTP</i>.\n"
"  To ni obvezno. Če uporabniškega imena in gesla ne določite, bo uporabljen "
"navadni SMTP.</p>\n"

#. Notification To (email addresses)
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:185
msgid ""
"<p><b>Notification To</b> Specify the email address to which a notification "
"email will be sent when a dump has been saved.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Obvestila Za</b> določa e-poštni naslov, na katerega se bo po "
"shranitvi odloženega izpisa poslala e-pošta z obvestilom.</p>\n"

#. Notification CC (email addresses)
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:189
msgid ""
"<p><b>Notification CC</b> Specify a list of space-separated email addresses "
"to\n"
" which a notification email will be sent via cc if a dump has been saved.</"
"p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Obvestila KP</b> določa seznam e-poštnih naslovov (ločenih s "
"presledkom), na\n"
"katere se bo po shranitvi odloženega izpisa poslala kopija e-pošte z "
"obvestilom.</p>\n"

#. Number of Old Dumps (number)
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:193
msgid ""
"<p><b>Number of Old Dumps</b> specifies how many old dumps are kept. If the "
"number of dump files \n"
"exceeds this number, older dumps are removed.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Število starih odloženih izpisov</b> določa, koliko starih odloženih "
"izpisov se ohrani. Če število\n"
"datotek presega to število, bodo najstarejše odvečne datoteke odstranjene.</"
"p>"

#. Read dialog help 1/2
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:197
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Initializing Kdump Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"Please wait...<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>Pripravljanje nastavitev Kdump</big></b><br>\n"
"Prosimo, počakajte …<br></p>\n"

#. Read dialog help 2/2
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:201
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Aborting Initialization:</big></b><br>\n"
"Safely abort the configuration utility by pressing <b>Abort</b> now.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>Prekinitev pripravljanja:</big></b><br>\n"
"Sedaj lahko varno prekinite nastavitveno orodje s klikom na <b>Prekini</b>.</"
"p>\n"

#. Write dialog help 1/2
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:205
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Saving Kdump Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"Please wait...<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>Shranjevanje nastavitev Kdump</big></b><br>\n"
"Prosimo, počakajte …<br></p>\n"

#. Write dialog help 2/2
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:209
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Aborting Saving:</big></b><br>\n"
"Abort the save procedure by pressing <b>Abort</b>.\n"
"An additional dialog informs whether it is safe to do so.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>Prekinitev shranjevanja:</big></b><br>\n"
"Prekinite shranjevanje s klikom na gumb <b>Prekini</b>.\n"
"Dodatno pogovorno okno vas bo obvestilo, ali je to varno narediti.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 1/3
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:216
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Kdump Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"Configure kdump here.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>Nastavitve Kdump</big></b><br>\n"
"Tu nastavite Kdump.<br></p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 2/3
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:220
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Adding a Kdump:</big></b><br>\n"
"Choose an kdump from the list of detected kdumps.\n"
"If your kdump was not detected, select <b>Other (not detected)</b>.\n"
"Then press <b>Configure</b>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>Dodajanje Kdump-a:</big></b><br>\n"
"Izberite kdump s seznama zaznanih.\n"
"Če želeni kdump ni bil zaznan, izberite <b>Drugi (nezaznan)</b>.\n"
"Nato kliknite <b>Nastavitve</b>.</p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 3/3
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:227
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Editing or Deleting:</big></b><br>\n"
"If you press <b>Edit</b>, an additional dialog in which to change\n"
"the configuration opens.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>Urejanje ali brisanje:</big></b><br>\n"
"Če kliknete <b>Urejanje</b>, se odpre dodatno\n"
"pogovorno okno v katerem lahko spremenite nastavitve.</p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 1/3
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:233
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Kdump Configuration Overview</big></b><br>\n"
"Obtain an overview of installed kdumps. Additionally\n"
"edit their configurations.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>Pregled nastavitev Kdump-a</big></b><br>\n"
"Prikazuje pregled nameščenih kdump-ov in omogoča\n"
"urejanje njihovih nastavitev.<br></p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 2/3
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:239
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Adding a Kdump:</big></b><br>\n"
"Press <b>Add</b> to configure a kdump.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>Dodajanje Kdump-a:</big></b><br>\n"
"S klikom na gumb <b>Dodaj</b> nastavite Kdump.</p>"

#. Ovreview dialog help 3/3
#: src/include/kdump/helps.rb:243
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Editing or Deleting:</big></b><br>\n"
"Choose a kdump to change or remove.\n"
"Then press <b>Edit</b> or <b>Delete</b> as desired.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>Urejanje ali brisanje:</big></b><br>\n"
"Izberite kdump, ki ga želite spremeniti ali odstraniti.\n"
"Po izbiri kliknite gumb <b>Urejanje</b> ali <b>Izbriši</b>.</p>\n"

